  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.18 Electronic record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.18 “Electronic record” means “electronic record” as defined in RSA 294-E:2, VII namely, “a record created, generated, sent, communicated, received, or stored by electronic means”.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.13); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.16) (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
